# Functional expected baselines

Never modify, overwrite, create, or Accept files under `**/test/functional/expected/**` (including copying `*-layout.json` outputs into expected).

When baselines need updating:

1. Leave the test failing against the current expected JSON (or missing expected).
2. Tell the user to Accept from the results page (`pnpm test:results`).
3. Do not refresh expected JSON to make tests pass.

Fix production/test harness code so checks catch real regressions; do not “fix” failures by updating baselines unless the user explicitly asks to Accept or update expected files.
